WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.933
(twangy music)

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:07.804
(audience laughs)

00:00:15.096 --> 00:00:17.929
(audience cheers)

00:00:19.516 --> 00:00:23.010
(plane engine roars)

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:26.499
(intense music)

00:00:26.499 --> 00:00:27.804
Lots of special events taking place

00:00:27.804 --> 00:00:30.672
in honor of Comic Con yesterday
at the San Diego Library.

00:00:30.672 --> 00:00:32.512
There was a Quidditch tournament.

00:00:32.512 --> 00:00:33.602
(audience cheers)

00:00:33.602 --> 00:00:34.435
Yeah.

00:00:34.435 --> 00:00:35.345
Yeah.

00:00:35.345 --> 00:00:36.178
Yes!

00:00:36.178 --> 00:00:37.011
Yes!

00:00:37.011 --> 00:00:38.328
And trust me, when a bunch
of adults get together

00:00:38.328 --> 00:00:40.610
to play Quidditch, there are no winners.

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:43.135
(audience laughs)

00:00:43.135 --> 00:00:45.269
(laughs) There were people, I'm sorry,

00:00:45.269 --> 00:00:47.965
there was a whole section
that was so happy.

00:00:47.965 --> 00:00:49.642
(laughs)

00:00:49.642 --> 00:00:51.591
"Conan likes Quidditch!

00:00:51.591 --> 00:00:53.341
Why would he say it?"

00:00:54.571 --> 00:00:55.958
Right now, they're hiding their brooms.

00:00:55.958 --> 00:00:57.330
[Conan] I know.

00:00:57.330 --> 00:00:59.406
White Walker is another name for?

00:00:59.406 --> 00:01:00.656
A Trump Cabinet member.

00:01:00.656 --> 00:01:04.823
(bell dings) (audience
laughs and applauds)

00:01:10.591 --> 00:01:14.678
What superhero smells
too strongly of cologne?

00:01:14.678 --> 00:01:16.344
Uberman! (bell dings)

00:01:16.344 --> 00:01:17.401
Uberman, yes!

00:01:17.401 --> 00:01:20.386
Will Smith, Joel Edgerton, Noomi Rapace,

00:01:20.386 --> 00:01:23.712
Lucy Fry, and director David Ayer!

00:01:23.712 --> 00:01:27.879
(upbeat music) (audience clapping)

00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:56.235
The witch-hunting, demon-slaying brothers

00:01:56.235 --> 00:01:58.120
Sam and Dean Winchester,

00:01:58.120 --> 00:02:00.808
Jared Padalecki and Jensen Ackles!

00:02:00.808 --> 00:02:04.975
(sci-fi music) (audience clapping)

00:02:19.115 --> 00:02:21.448
(screaming)

00:02:24.066 --> 00:02:25.606
What?

00:02:25.606 --> 00:02:26.524
Oh!

00:02:26.524 --> 00:02:28.804
Look who came crawling back!

00:02:28.804 --> 00:02:30.104
Well settle in.

00:02:30.104 --> 00:02:32.854
It's only two hours to San Diego.

